}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 7,
  "Delib_start_time": null,
  "Delib_end_time": "3:54 p.m.",
  "notes": "Jury resumed deliberations at 9:00 a.m. (deliberations started on a prior day). The Court questioned the jury about an unintentional 'question mark' on the Special Verdict Form; the Foreperson circled and initialed the item. Jury was polled, verdict received at 4:10 p.m., jury excused at 4:11 p.m. Time in court was only 8 minutes. Document is an amended courtroom minutes entry."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 4,
  "Delib_start_time": "9:41 a.m.",
  "Delib_end_time": "11:58 a.m.",
  "notes": "There was a mid-deliberation recess (11:00 a.m. to 11:58 a.m.) during which the court addressed jurors' questions with parties; Mr. Polin appeared by phone for that session. After verdict was read, court granted plaintiff's oral request for a permanent injunction enjoining the Board of County Commissioners from enforcing its zoning code in a way that would require the sober living house to be removed, subject to submission of a written order. Total court time recorded as 01:06."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 6,
  "Delib_start_time": null,
  "Delib_end_time": null,
  "notes": "Case settled before jury deliberations began. Court imposed jury costs of $4,950.76 to be paid equally between plaintiff and defendants. Order Dismissing Case with Prejudice signed. Jury was informed of settlement and discharged. No verdict was reached. Total court time on final day was 16 minutes."
}

{
  "Delib_start_time": null,
  "Delib_adjourn_time": "5:24 p.m.",
  "Delib_resume_time": null,
  "notes": "Deliberations did not actually begin on this day. The jury was sent into recess until Tuesday, August 12, 2014, commencing at 8:30 a.m. (MDT) to commence deliberations. Closing arguments were completed, jury instructions were given, and the jury was adjourned before deliberations began. The court noted it would reconvene August 12, 2014 at approximately 4:45 p.m. (MDT) unless a question or verdict notice was received sooner. Exhibits 42-44, 132, and 177 were excluded from evidence available to the jury. Corrected jury instructions were distributed to jurors and counsel."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 7,
