  "Delib_end_time": "11:42 a.m.",
  "notes": "Deliberations began at 9:00 a.m. on this final day (Day 5) per the minutes narrative, but no formal timestamp entry marks that start — it is described in prose only. The jury had reconvened from a prior day. Verdict was in favor of plaintiff and against all defendants. Counsel declined jury poll. Total session time was 11 minutes."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 7,
  "Delib_start_time": "9:00 a.m.",
  "Delib_end_time": "4:26 p.m.",
  "notes": "Jury sent two questions during deliberations (at 2:45 p.m. and 3:59 p.m.). Court responded in writing to the first question and read jury instruction 28 aloud for the second. Jury was briefly brought into courtroom at 4:10 p.m. for the second question response before resuming deliberations. Verdict reached and read at 4:30 p.m.; jury polled at 4:31 p.m. and discharged at 4:35 p.m. Defendant's Motion to Strike Plaintiff's Expert Economist (ECF Doc. No. 153) denied as moot. Exhibits returned to counsel at conclusion of trial. Total court time recorded as 31 minutes."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 5,
